			icon: "aquaculture:fish_fillet_cooked"
			description: ["Nella: \"Ten, any ten. The lake isn't fussy and neither am I.\"", "", "Cast Nella's Iron Rod from the shore until you have caught 10 fish of any kind, then cook one cod on a Farmer's Delight Skillet and hand the cooked cod in. Nothing is counting the ten for you — tick that box yourself when you know you are there.", "", "The Dredge Net comes out of this, and the dredge is where the sand for the workshop's first machine comes from."]
