		{
			id: "2F56F12A0B4EDB5F"
			title: "Bring Halden 8 Poppies, 8 Dandelions and 8 Cornflowers"
			subtitle: "Eight of each, to Halden on the south slope."
			icon: "minecraft:poppy"
			description: ["Halden: \"Nothing in a hedge garden is urgent. That is more or less the entire argument for having one.\"", "", "Plant Wisp's poppy, dandelion and cornflower in the three flower boxes on your window ledge, then bone-meal the grass on the flat by the Town Anchor — that ground is plains, and plains grows all three — until you have 8 of each. Bring all 24 to Halden on the south slope.", "", "Halden moves into the hedge garden, the spring above it starts running, and the trellis and grape starts for the slope come with him."]
			x: 2.0d
			y: -0.8d
			dependencies: ["1589859EB1A28DCE", "B5951AD29E0D22D4"]
