			icon: "valley:lake_sand"
			description: ["Nella: \"Sit down, hold the rope, don't help. You never get in the water on my boat.\"", "", "Sit in Nella's boat over the marked shallows and use the Dredge Net six times. Each pull brings up 16 Lake Sand; hand in 96 — the book counts it, then gives it straight back for Bram.", "", "Lake Sand is the only source of Washed Silica, and Washed Silica is the only way to a Thermal Machine Frame — Bram cannot start the workshop without it."]
