		{
			id: "0EF7850DDAE28ADA"
			title: "Wash Lake Sand Into 64 Washed Silica"
			subtitle: "Fan over running water, sand underneath."
			icon: "valley:washed_silica"
			description: ["Bram: \"Fan over running water, sand on the belt underneath. Wash it twice if it still looks like a beach.\"", "", "Two Lake Sand and a bucket of water make one Washed Silica on the bench, so 64 silica is 128 sand — Nella's net is still yours for the last two pulls. (An Encased Fan blowing down through water does the same job, if you would rather watch it happen.)", "", "Washed Silica is the gate item on the Thermal Machine Frame — press U on the frame in JEI and the silica is sitting in the grid where the tin used to be."]
