		}
		{
			id: "4D0BC5F83B1DC875"
			title: "Craft Your First Thermal Machine Frame"
			subtitle: "Washed Silica plus tin from Tobin's deposit."
			icon: "thermal:machine_frame"
			description: ["Bram: \"Her drawing, her handwriting, and I couldn't make it work in thirty years. You have the sand, so try.\"", "", "Take Bram's crate of Josie's papers and craft one Thermal Machine Frame — Washed Silica plus tin from the deposit Tobin pinned on your map. Hold it to hand it in.", "", "Every Thermal machine is that frame with an RF Coil under it — silver and redstone, wound. Tobin's second map has the silver seam two ridges over, and Oda sells eight coils for 18 Scrip once her board is open. The Stirling Dynamo in this payout is the workshop's first real power."]
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
			dependencies: ["0EF7850DDAE28ADA"]
