			description: ["Bram: \"Two dust out of one ore. That's not a trick, that's just knowing what a hammer is for.\"", "", "Build a Thermal Pulverizer on the Machine Frame and put the Stirling Dynamo against its input face — it burns what the bread oven burns, and a stack of charcoal runs it all evening. Run 32 iron ore through and hand in 32 Iron Dust.", "", "Ore is doubled from here on, and the second dynamo is what lights the first two lamp posts on the road."]
