			title: "Place 4 Lamp Posts and Run Energy Duct to Two of Them"
			subtitle: "Four marked spots, mill to square."
			icon: "minecraft:lantern"
			description: ["Oda: \"Six lamps lit, thirty-four dark. I count them every night whether I mean to or not.\"", "", "Put one lamp post on each of the 4 marked spots between the mill and the square, then run Energy Duct from the Stirling Dynamo at the mill to the nearest two — the furnace eats power, the dynamo makes it, so wire from the dynamo's output face. Any order is right. Every post and every length of duct is in the crate at the mill door.", "", "Lamps 10 of 40. Nothing hostile spawns anywhere along the lit road, for good."]
