			title: "Craft 24 Paper Lanterns With Marnie and Pip"
			subtitle: "Eight paper around one torch, six times."
			icon: "valley:paper_lantern"
			description: ["Marnie: \"Nella says nobody will come, and Nella has made forty of these. Draw your own conclusions, love.\"", "", "Eight paper around one torch makes four Paper Lanterns — six batches for twenty-four, so 48 paper and 6 torches. Oda's crate holds 24 paper and 24 torches; the rest is sugar cane off the reeds under Wisp's stilt house, three to a sheet. Any crafting table will do.", "", "These are the lanterns that go on the water at the Float. The festival clothes and 20 Valley Scrip come with them."]
