		{
			id: "D51AAB093CEA5743"
			title: "Fill Oda's Three Notices: 24 Wheat, 8 Cooked Fish, 8 Wool"
			subtitle: "Act II finale — the Midsummer Lantern Float."
			icon: "bountiful:bountyboard"
			description: ["Oda: \"Three notices on the board and all three get filled the same week. That has not happened since Josie.\"", "", "Take 24 wheat off your fields, 8 cooked cod off Nella's lake and 8 white wool off Cloud and Also Cloud, and hand all three notices in at the board outside the store.", "", "Forty lamps. Fifteen people. One winter that nobody leaves.", "", "Then everybody walks down to the water and puts the lanterns on it — and for the first summer in eleven years, this valley is a place people come back to instead of a place people leave."]
